<article class="lesson">
  <h1>🎯 Prompt Engineering — To'liq Kurs</h1>

  <section>
    <h2>1. Nima uchun Prompt Engineering kerak?</h2>
    <p>
      AI modellari (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) juda kuchli, lekin ular <strong>telepatiya qila olmaydi</strong>.
      Siz noto'g'ri yozsangiz — noto'g'ri javob olasiz. Prompt Engineering — bu
      AI bilan <strong>to'g'ri muloqot qilish san'ati</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Oddiy misol: "Menga matn yozing" deb aytsangiz — AI umumiy, zerikarli narsa yozadi.
      Lekin "IELTS Writing Task 2 uchun 250 so'zli, rasmiy uslubda, 3 paragrafli essay yozing" desangiz —
      aniq natija olasiz.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>2. O'rgansa qanday foyda olasiz?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>⏱ <strong>Vaqt tejash:</strong> 1 soatlik ishni 5 daqiqaga tushirosisz</li>
      <li>💰 <strong>Pul ishlash:</strong> kontent, kod, tarjima — tezroq qilasiz</li>
      <li>📈 <strong>Sifat:</strong> aniq, strukturaviy natija</li>
      <li>🧠 <strong>Bilim:</strong> AI ni "hamkor" sifatida ishlata olasiz</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>3. Qayerda qo'llay olasiz?</h2>
    <div class="use-cases">
      <div><strong>✍️ Yozish:</strong> maqola, essay, post, email</div>
      <div><strong>💻 Kod:</strong> Python, JavaScript, debug</div>
      <div><strong>🔬 Tadqiqot:</strong> ma'lumot yig'ish, xulosa</div>
      <div><strong>💼 Biznes:</strong> reja, pitch, mijoz xatlar</div>
      <div><strong>📚 O'qish:</strong> IELTS, Admissions, materiallar</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>4. Amaliy mashg'ulot</h2>
    <p>Quyidagi prompt'ni sinab ko'ring:</p>
    <pre><code>"Men IELTS 6.5 kerak. Menga 30 kunlik writing rejasi tuzib bering: har kun nima qilishim kerak, qancha vaqt, qanday mashqlar."</code></pre>
    <p>Natijani Obsidian'ga saqlang (Strawberryboo orqali forward qiling).</p>
  </section>

  <p class="price">💎 Kurs narxi: <strong>$29</strong> (bir martalik to'lov)</p>
